# A pressure ramp, a tilted stroke, a barrel button and the eraser (WS079 p002).
# The pause after size lets a reader (peninject -d) open the new node first.
size 21600 13500
wait 1500
tool pen
hover 1000 1000 0 0
down 1000 1000 0 10 -10
ramp 0 4095 64 5
move 2000 1500 4095 20 -20
move 3000 2000 2048 30 -30
button stylus 1
button stylus 0
up
tool rubber
down 5000 5000 1024
move 5500 5200 2048
up
hold 500
